Domain name: NMG.com
OUs created: Finance, HR, IT, Operations
Security groups created: Finance-Users, HR-Users, IT-Users, Operations-Users.
Below are the descriptions of different types of Organization Units (OUs).
Finance: Managing the organization's financial activities for users.
HR: User creation containing employees responsible for managing personnel records
IT: Creation of Users responsible for managing the organization's technology infrastructure
Operations: Creation of Users responsible for the organization's daily business activities, processes, services, and operational support.
